type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ちょっと！ 女の胸に触らないで！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000986|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"顔に気をつけろ、このドジ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009E9|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なんで顔を近づけてくるんだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080E|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何がしたいのか知らないけど、そもそもお互いのパーツって合うの？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000810|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それ以上続けたら、股間を蹴り上げてやるからね！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081D|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いい、わたしはそういう女じゃないの、わかった？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000822|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あらっ！ 乱暴なのがお好みってわけ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000826|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"体を触ろうってわけ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082A|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"エルフをちょっと味見したいってわけ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000831|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"このぶつかり方、まさかいやらしい理由じゃないでしょうね？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083B|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そのポケットの中のもの、短剣だといいんだけど…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083C|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"さっき「ハサミ」の話をしてたのって…まさか…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000842|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この者はそういう意味の「子猫ちゃん」ではない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000847|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ノルドの女が好みってわけ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000849|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"今日はずいぶんお盛んじゃない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000848|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あらら。あんた、そっちの趣味の女なのね？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000859|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"タマを蹴り上げられたいの？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000860|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ、このバカ野郎！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000861|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけな、このドジ女！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000866|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それがオークの交尾の始め方だって、知ってるわよね？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000872|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"乱暴なのが好きなの？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000879|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この大バカ者！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00087F|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あらあら！ ポケットに入ってるのは魂石？ それともわたしに会えて嬉しいだけかしら？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000880|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あら、今日はちょっとお盛んじゃない？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000881|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ズボンの中にしまっておきなさい、坊や！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000882|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あらぁ！ 誰かさん、わたしにちょっと惚れちゃった？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00088A|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ちょっと！ わたしのマンモスの…あー、何でもないわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000889|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"待って！ 今の何？ わかってるでしょ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00088B|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"その膨らみ、ただの水袋だといいんだけど？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000892|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"このバカ野郎！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000896|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ！ このバカ野郎！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000899|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけろ、このクソ間抜け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008A2|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"下がれ、この大バカ者！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008A7|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"このドジな間抜け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008AD|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"とんでもない鈍感か？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B3|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"やめろ、この大バカ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B9|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい、このまぬけ野郎！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C0|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"忌々しいンワーめ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D6|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"悪いな、お嬢ちゃん。酔っぱらいすぎて…その…わかるだろ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008EB|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"自分が何してるか気をつけろ、このうすのろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008EF|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"このドジ女！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F0|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この盲目野郎！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FB|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なんてこった！ 目が見えないのか！？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000911|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なんてこった！ 気をつけろ、このクソ間抜け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000912|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"バカなのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00091F|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どけ、このクソ野郎！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00092A|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もう一度やってみろ、腕を引きちぎってその血まみれの方でひっぱたいてやる！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000947|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お前、とんでもないバカなのか？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000953|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"失せろ、この田舎者！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000983|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ずいぶんとお盛んなのね？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000987|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけろ、この間抜けなン'ワーめ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009EA|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけろ、この間抜けなン'ワーめ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080D|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何やってんだ、このバカで間抜けな猫め！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000811|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1"