抜けなウロコトカゲめ！ 見えなかったのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00092C|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"このっ！ その前足を切り落としてやろうか！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00092D|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どけ、このデカいだけのウスノロ！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000934|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おっと、ちょっと気まずかったね。オークまずい、なんてね？ わかる？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000935|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ふふっ！ あなたのヒゲで顔がくすぐったいわ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000936|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ひっ！ お願い、噛まないで！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000940|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どけ、トカゲ。力ずくでどかされる前にな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000941|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"失せろ、ヒゲ野郎！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000948|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どけ、この臭い毛玉！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000949|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"このドジなトカゲめ！ 気をつけろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000951|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"非インペリアルのクズどもめ、くたばれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000817|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけろ、この汚らわしいエルフ！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00095E|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うっ！ 倒れるところだったじゃないか！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00095D|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"痛っ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00095C|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"傷つけないで！ お願い！ ","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CB|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"足元に気をつけろ、このぶくぶく太った道化め！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000962|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけろ、このバカ者！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D1|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もっと気をつけろ、この歯抜けのもぐもぐ乞食！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000960|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけろ、このとんま！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000961|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"間抜けなンワーめ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CE|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どけ、このだらしなしの小汚い奴！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CC|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どけ、この野良育ちの下っ端！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D2|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"目が見えないのか、このあほうどり！？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000964|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"痛っ！ 体が！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000965|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あらまあ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000968|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ！ 老いぼれて疲れたこの骨が！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000969|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"年寄りの女をそんなふうに扱うもんじゃないよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D3|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どこ見て歩いてる、この間抜けなぐうたら野郎！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00096A|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お願い、殺さないで！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00096B|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あら？ 気を引こうとしてるの？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00096D|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"頭に石でも詰まってるの？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C9|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どけ、このとんちき！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CA|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"下がれ、下郎！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CF|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"やめろ、この泥んこ小僧！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D0|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけろ、このうつけ者！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C3|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"間抜けなンワーめ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D7|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"今のは何なんだ！？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E0|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"失せろ、劣等種め！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E1|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"触るな、クズが！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E3|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ 気をつけろ、このスキーヴァー頭！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F3|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どうかしてるのか！？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F4|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"やめろ、このトンマ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F5|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"死にたいのか！？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F9|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"牢屋で一晩過ごしたいのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FA|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"時々、我々衛兵は透明人間なんじゃないかと思うよ。わかるだろ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00090B|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ このカジートが歩いているんだぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000910|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ こっちは歩いてるんだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00091D|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"やる気か？ あぁ？ やるってのか？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00091E|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"牢屋にぶち込まれたいのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CD|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"やめろ、このデブのろま！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000930|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あっ、ごめんなさい。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000931|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、どうか許してくれ、友よ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000939|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ぐあぁっ！！ 肋骨が折れたかもしれん！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00093A|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ぐあぁっ！！ ","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00093E|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"今のは挑戦か？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000945|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい、バカ！ ここにいるだろうが！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00094F|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"喧嘩を売ってるのか？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000954|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まったく！ もっと気をつけられないのか？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000959|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"痛っ！ 痛いじゃないか！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000981|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何のつもりだい？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00094E|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"俺の店に来ておいて、こんな扱いをするのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00096E|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけな！ でないと宿から叩き出すよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00098F|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ 俺の宿では行儀よくしろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000995|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけて！ せめて私の宿では礼儀を守ってちょうだい！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000990|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ちょっと！ デッドマンズ・ドリンクで揉め事はごめんだよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000999|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ 私の宿では気をつけてくれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00099A|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"放っておいて。でないと追い出すわよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000955|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"有名な吟遊詩人の顔をよく見たかったのかい？ まあ、無理もないな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00096C|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"胸元を覗こうとしてるの？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000970|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"牢屋にぶち込んでやる！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000976|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ 気をつけろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000977|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけろ、このマヌケ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000978|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ 勘弁してくれよ、このアホ野郎！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00098A|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ やめないと部下をけしかけるぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00098B|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おっと！ 今のは予想外だったよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00098C|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ 私を誰だと思っている？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00098D|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"衛兵！ 襲われている！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00098E|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ちょっと！ 強いノルドの女にそんな真似はさせないわよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000991|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"男の人に触れられるのって素敵ね。そうでしょ、クレッパー？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000992|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"んん、好きなだけぶつかってきていいのよ、坊や。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000993|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もう一回やって！ 噛みついたりしないわ……あなたが望まない限りはね。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000994|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ。ムジョルもあんなふうに触れてくれたらいいのに！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000996|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"んん、お楽しみをお探し？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00099B|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"放っておいてくれ、ノルド！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00099C|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あら。ディベラの愛をお求め？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00099D|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"んん。私と一緒にディベラの技を学びたいの？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00099E|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ええ、いいわ！ ディベラもあなたの行いをお喜びになるでしょう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00099F|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"んんっ！ もう一回して！ 気持ちよかったわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009A0|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ わしはこの地の首長だぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009A1|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"手を放せ！ 私は首長だぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009A2|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"その手をどけろ！ 私は首長だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009A3|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長に手を出すとはどういうつもり？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009A4|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"これはどういうことなの？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009A5|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長にそんなことをするなんて！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009A6|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ホワイトランの首長にこんな無礼を働くのか？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009A7|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ 私は首長だぞ！ やめろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009A9|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なんだ？！ わしが首長だと分からんのか？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009AA|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"衛兵！ 今のを見たか？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009AB|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"これが首長に対する態度なの？！ 衛兵！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009AC|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どきなさい！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009AD|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よくもやったな？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009AE|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長に手を出すとはいい度胸だな？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009AF|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"礼儀はどこへやった？ 私は首長だぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009B6|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"喧嘩を売ってるのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009B7|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"距離を取れ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009C2|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"衛兵！ バルグルーフをお守りしろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009BC|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長に触れるな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009BD|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"衛兵！ 警戒しろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009BE|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長をお守りしろ、何か起きるかもしれん！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009BF|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長に構うな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009C0|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ここで揉め事は御免だ。首長から離れろ。今すぐだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009C1|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長に妙な真似はするなよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009C4|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ 首長に近づくな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009C3|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"衛兵！ しっかりしろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009D8|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけろ！ 衛兵！ 何か起きるかもしれん！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009D9|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まずい！ 衛兵、警戒しろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009DA|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長からは安全な距離を保て。いいな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009DB|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うっ！ 衛兵！ この男を見張れ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009DC|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なんだ？ 衛兵！ この女を見張れ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009DD|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長に何をしている？！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009DE|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長から離れてもらおう！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009DF|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！ 首長に構うな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009E0|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"衛兵！ 首長をお守りしろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009BA|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009C6|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"我らの首長から離れろ！ 今すぐ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009C7|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よせ、揉め事は御免だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009C8|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"バカな真似はよせ。下がれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009C9|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい、やめろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009E2|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"警告するぞ。下がれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009E4|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何をしているつもりだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009CA|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"これ以上妙な動きをするな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009CB|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おいおい、よせって！ 落ち着け。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009E1|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"警告するぞ。下がれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009CD|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ん？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009E7|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"見ているぞ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009CE|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ん？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009E5|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何をしているつもりだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009CF|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ん？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009D1|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"さっさと行け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009E6|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"目を付けてるからな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009D2|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"さっさと行け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009E8|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"自分のしていることに気をつけろ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009D3|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"さっさと行け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009D5|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"立ち止まるな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0009D7|collision dialogue overhaul.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"首長に近づくな！","index":1}]